{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI have arrived safely in Magdeburg. The afternoon was agreeable; I inspected the cathedral and its striking apostle statues, then called on General Carnot. Walking the Elbe bank, I watched thirteen Hamburg ships sail in—a fine sight of commerce.\n\nI am staying here until Tuesday noon, when the coach to Kassel departs. An Englishman has hired a coachman for a three-day drive to Kassel, which I hope will keep me company. The journey is slow, but I find the delay pleasant. I have eaten well and taken my snuff.\n\nDo not worry for me. I am in good spirits and looking forward to the final leg. I shall write again from Kassel.\n\nYours ever,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795218887,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":160,"prompt_tokens":955,"total_tokens":1115,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-vrHhW1gOgAoUbIH8SCLLzeV2SPxJD5l1","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":955,"prompt_ms":889.403,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9313120418848168,"prompt_per_second":1073.7539675490189,"predicted_n":160,"predicted_ms":3753.34,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.605911949685535,"predicted_per_second":42.36226933877559}}